    <description>Warmup: 10min from 45% to 70% FTP | Steady: 10min @ 75% FTP | Steady: 5min @ 55% FTP | Steady: 10min @ 85% FTP | Steady: 5min @ 55% FTP | Steady: 10min @ 95% FTP | Cooldown: 10min from 65% to 45% FTP</description>
